"""Crate & Barrel category inventory (site taxonomy, grouped by department).

Source of truth: https://www.crateandbarrel.com/assets/sitemap-plp.xml
(advertised from robots.txt via /assets/sitemap-index.xml; captured 2026-10-14
through the configured ScrapeOps residential proxy). Every category
product-listing page is a ``/<department>/<sub>.../<leaf>/<page>`` URL; the
sitemap lists each one at page ``/1``. That yields 1884 crawlable leaves
across 35 top-level departments.

The Airflow DAG schedules one task per leaf and the GCS output path is the
bare leaf name, so leaf keys are the full ``<department>/<sub>.../<leaf>``
path slug -- globally unique for the handful of labels that recur under
several departments (``blankets``, ``beds``, ``solid-rugs``, ...).
"""
